      "statusChangeID": "66608d234249610280d197f9",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "Thank you for the report! We're working on a fix.\n\nThis bug appeared because VRChat recently started blocking `Input.GetKey` unless VRChat's menu is closed. (See https://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/input-events#unity-input-methods-and-properties)\n\nIn the SDK, there *is* no VRChat menu, so input was erroneously being blocked all the time! We'll have it fixed in the next SDK release.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
